# Database dumps land here, inside the working tree the deploy job runs
# `git checkout -f` in. Untracked files survive that, but they would not survive
# a `git clean -fd` -- which is exactly the sort of thing someone reaches for
# while recovering, and the backups are what they would be recovering with.
backups/
